[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Not a Baby]
[00:00.90]Lesson 65 | 第65课
[00:02.94]Not a baby | 不是小孩子
[00:05.56]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.06]Does Jill take the key to the front door? | 吉尔拿走了前门的钥匙吗？
[00:16.54]What are you going to do this evening, Jill? | 吉尔，你今晚打算做什么？
[00:22.24]I'm going to meet some friends, Dad. | 爸爸，我打算去见几个朋友。
[00:26.64]You mustn't come home late. | 你不许回来太晚。
[00:29.86]You must be home at half past ten. | 你必须在十点半之前到家。
[00:34.58]I can't get home so early, Dad! | 爸爸，我不能那么早回家！
[00:39.03]Can I have the key to the front door, please? | 我能拿前门的钥匙吗？
[00:43.84]No, you can't. | 不，你不能。
[00:47.11]Jill's eighteen years old, Tom. | 吉尔已经十八岁了，汤姆。
[00:51.52]She's not a baby. | 她不是小孩子。
[00:54.31]Give her the key. | 把钥匙给她吧。
[00:56.68]She always comes home early. | 她总是回家很早的。
[01:00.62]Oh, all right! | 哦，好吧！
[01:03.87]Here you are. | 给你。
[01:05.77]But you mustn't come home after a quarter past eleven. | 但是你不能在十一点一刻之后回家。
[01:11.40]Do you hear? | 听到了吗？
[01:13.19]Yes, Dad. | 是的，爸爸。
[01:15.37]Thanks, Mum. | 谢谢，妈妈。
[01:17.50]That's all right. | 没关系。
[01:19.58]Goodbye. | 再见。
[01:21.09]Enjoy yourself! | 玩得开心！
[01:23.75]We always enjoy ourselves, Mum. | 妈妈，我们总是玩得很开心的。
[01:28.13]Bye-bye. | 再见。